      "value": "@{5fca5df4d58780532024a52b|full_name}: DrBlackRat: if you consider ik smoothing then this could also potentially cause an issue with the handle scenario to. While you may have perfectly aligned the handle in your hand when you grabbed it another player may not have seen your hand in that perfect position if you go too fast and it would cause it to be offset for them once grabbed. This will likely constantly snowball as you continue to grab and drop since you’ll be grabbing at a greater offset each time since it’s not snapping to a predetermined location.",
